<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n91621" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πῠρεῖον</span></b> , 
			Ion.
		
		<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πυργ-ήϊον</span></b> , τό, mostly in pl., <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>firesticks,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				h.Merc.
				111
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>Ph.</u>
				36
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Thphr.
				<u>HP</u>
				5.3.4
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				D.S.
				5.67
			</span></i>, etc.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τάχ᾽ ἂν . . τρίβοντες, ὥσπερ ἐκ
					πυρείων, ἐκλάμψαι ποιήσαιμεν τὴν δικαιοσύνην</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>R.</u>
					435a
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πυοεῖά τε</span>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χερσὶν ἐνώμων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Theoc.
					22.33
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀμφὶ πυρήϊα δινεύεσκον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.R.
					1.1184
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πυρεῖα συντρίψαντες</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Luc.
					<u>VH</u>
					1.32
				</span></i>
			; the stationary piece was called <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐσχάρα</span>, the drill <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τρύπανον</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Thphr.
				<u>Ign.</u>
				64
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> sg.,
				<i>earthen pan for coals</i> (= <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θυμιατήριον</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i> (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πυρίον</span>), <i><span class="en">
				Phot.
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Suid.
			</span></i>), <i><span class="en">
				LXX
				<u>Ex.</u>
				27.3
			</span></i>: pl., ib.<i><span class="en">
				<u>2 Ch.</u>
				4.11
			</span></i>,<i><span class="en">
				21
			</span></i>.</div>
